{"unit_id":"Cloud017__dsh-prompt-reforge#feature-1","repo":"Cloud017/dsh-prompt-reforge","commit":"306ffe74c455143cd3c610ebd205d32c95ed0484","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-prompt-reforge 的功能「草稿提示词重写」：将输入框中的草稿交给当前会话已选的模型，按照保留原意、语言和长度的要求整理成更明确的提示词。点击输入栏按钮触发，结果替换当前草稿。","evidence":["lib/client.js:493-509","lib/index.js:97-119","lib/prompts.js:18-42"],"source":"generated"}
{"unit_id":"Cloud017__dsh-prompt-reforge#feature-2","repo":"Cloud017/dsh-prompt-reforge","commit":"306ffe74c455143cd3c610ebd205d32c95ed0484","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-prompt-reforge 的功能「恢复原稿与取消」：改写成功后再次点击同一按钮可恢复备份草稿；改写进行时点击可取消请求。按钮仅在有可写草稿且已选择模型时启用。","evidence":["lib/client.js:440-470","lib/client.js:483-509"],"source":"generated"}
{"unit_id":"Cloud017__dsh-prompt-reforge#caveat-1","repo":"Cloud017/dsh-prompt-reforge","commit":"306ffe74c455143cd3c610ebd205d32c95ed0484","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-prompt-reforge 使用前须知：改写请求包含草稿文本，并通过宿主 LLM 服务提交给当前会话选择的 provider 和 model；实际处理服务取决于该会话的模型路由。源码未设置单独的 API Key。","evidence":["lib/client.js:493-494","lib/index.js:97-110","lib/llm.js:79-106"],"source":"generated"}
